OL,3,ASurgeon having lunch near Krakow
OL,4,Ashooting undoubtedly saved officer's
OL,5,Alife, colleague says
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of two surgeons who treated victims
OL,8,Fon the streets in the aftermath of a
OL,9,Fmass shooting in Krakow, Poland said
OL,10,Fhis colleague"undoubtedly" saved the
OL,11,Flife of a gravely injured police
OL,12,Fofficer.
OL,14,FThe pair had been eating near the
OL,15,Fcity's Main Market Square on Saturday
OL,16,Fwhen a gunman began firing at random,
OL,17,Fkilling six and injuring 15.
OL,19,FThe doctors raced to treat both the
OL,20,Fattacker and two police officers who
OL,21,Fwere shot while subduing the
OL,22,Fperpetrator.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
